@startuml
title SplitSmart system context and trust boundaries
left to right direction
actor Member
actor Owner
actor Reviewer
rectangle "SplitSmart trust boundary" {
 component "Browser adapter\n(full product path)" as Web
 component "Swing adapter\n(MVP proposal)" as Swing
 component "Application + domain" as Core
}
database "Persistent records\ntechnology TBD" as DB
cloud "Email / identity\nprovider TBD" as IDP
cloud "Notification channel\nTBD" as Notify
cloud "Private receipt store\nproposal" as Receipt
Member --> Web
Owner --> Web
Reviewer --> Web
Member --> Swing
Web --> Core
Swing --> Core
Core --> DB
Core --> IDP
Core --> Notify
Core --> Receipt
note right of Swing: Desktop-only; not NFR-001 compliant.
note bottom of Core: Reauthorize membership at every data boundary.
@enduml
